  "about": {
    "stamp": "Plate 05 · At the stall, October",
    "eyebrow": "About Karineko",
    "heading": "The beauty of finding something rare.",
    "body_html": "<p>Karineko is a small, independent shop in London.</p><p>We find our pieces in person and at a few trusted auctions in Japan, and keep only those with something to say. Each one is checked by hand, for authenticity and condition, before it comes to you.</p><p>Luxury, we think, should feel personal, not out of reach.</p><p><em>A past worth keeping.</em></p>"
